WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.054 --> 00:00:05.221
- [Narrator] Most people think
this fruit smells terrible.

00:00:06.396 --> 00:00:08.078
It's been described using words like,

00:00:08.078 --> 00:00:10.779
rotting onions or raw sewage.

00:00:10.779 --> 00:00:12.446
Not this guy, though.

00:00:13.561 --> 00:00:16.144
(lively music)

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:37.842
If you're not that familiar with durian,

00:00:37.842 --> 00:00:40.759
it has a spiky rind and the inside,

00:00:42.082 --> 00:00:45.484
is a yellow, soft colored creamy fruit.

00:00:45.484 --> 00:00:48.468
It's native to Southeast Asia and

00:00:48.468 --> 00:00:50.031
because of its odor, is actually

00:00:50.031 --> 00:00:52.614
banned from many public places.

00:01:08.981 --> 00:01:11.861
Besides having a distinctive smell,

00:01:11.861 --> 00:01:15.163
durian also has a distinctive taste.

00:01:15.163 --> 00:01:17.580
- It's like a peanut caramel.

00:01:29.871 --> 00:01:31.468
- [Narrator] Numb taste literally means

00:01:31.468 --> 00:01:33.170
your mouth will go numb.

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:35.753
- Wow, I can feel the numbness.

00:01:40.593 --> 00:01:42.759
- This might well be
my new favorite fruit.

00:01:42.759 --> 00:01:46.108
- [Narrator] People in general,
are divided on this fruit.

00:01:46.108 --> 00:01:48.492
Those who love it, love it.

00:01:48.492 --> 00:01:50.453
- The durian is so tasty.

00:01:50.453 --> 00:01:51.369
- It's really good.

00:01:51.369 --> 00:01:54.369
- Tastes much better than it smells.

00:02:07.979 --> 00:02:10.217
- [Narrator] And there are others

00:02:10.217 --> 00:02:13.050
who just can't get past the smell.

00:02:16.781 --> 00:02:20.198
For Durian Seng, it is the perfect fruit.

